de Valmont, they turn seduction into strategy and weaponise desire. But when their alliance collapses into rivalry, the battle between them threatens to destroy everyone in their path.\\n\\nFilmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Marianne Elliott (Angels in America) directs this thrilling game of love, lies, and social warfare.\",\"starring\":\"Lesley Manville, Aidan Turner\",\"directedBy\":\"Marianne Elliott\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":180,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"wq5l5VV51sU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-25\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-06-25\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"477673\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Untitled NT Live Event (25Th June 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99102799993,\\\"daysShown\\\":44,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":true,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-now-playing showing-status-now-playing-or-has-played\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"375803\",\"time\":\"2026-06-25T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":95,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":6,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"453455\",\"time\":\"2026-07-03T12:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":81,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"453460\",\"time\":\"2026-07-16T18:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":19,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"se