ee of £3 per person is payable to the quiz host on the evening.\\n\\nAdvanced booking is strongly recommended.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":null,\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-12\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"416\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99207199993,\\\"daysShown\\\":139,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":true,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Lounge \\\\u0026 Terrace\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Lounge \\\\u0026 Terrace\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-lounge--terrace some-showings-lounge--terrace every-showings-lounge--terrace showing-status-has-played showing-status-now-playing-or-has-played\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"364653\",\"time\":\"2025-11-06T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"447\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"lounge--terrace\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"386589\",\"time\":\"2026-01-13T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"447\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"lounge--terrace\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"396105\",\"time\":\"2026-02-10T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"447\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"lounge--terrace\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"406971\",\"time\":\"2026-03-10T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"447\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"lounge--terrace\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"414948\",\"time\":\"2026-05-12T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":56,\"screenId\":\"447\",\"seatsRemaining\":0,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"lounge--terrace\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"434443\",\"time\":\"2026-06-09T18:00:00