\",\"time\":\"2026-08-29T13:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"464776\",\"time\":\"2026-08-30T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34093\",\"name\":\"Lilo \\u0026 Stitch\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"lilo-stitch\",\"posterImage\":\"5ozpkqfmagorn53pvia6c6orj543\",\"bannerImage\":\"hrek1eqdm2hzxn54l8v1vrorqymj\",\"synopsis\":\"A live-action reimagining of Disney’s 2002 animated classic, “Lilo \\u0026 Stitch” is the wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family. Directed by Dean Fleischer Camp, the Oscar®-nominated filmmaker behind the animated feature film “Marcel the Shell with Shoes On,” the film stars Sydney Elizebeth Agudong, Billy Magnussen, Tia Carrere, Hannah Waddingham, Chris Sanders, with Courtney B. Vance, and Zach Galifianakis, introducing Maia Kealoha. “Lilo \\u0026 Stitch” is produced by Jonathan Eirich, p.g.a. and Dan Lin, with Louie Provost, Tom Peitzman and Ryan Halprin serving as executive producers.\",\"starring\":\"Maia Kealoha, Sydney Agudong, Chris Sanders\",\"directedBy\":\"Dean Fleischer Camp\",\"producedBy\":\"Dan Lin, Jonathan Eirich\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":108,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family, Science Fiction, Comedy\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"pKmKt8mPAL4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":17.9058,\"tmdbId\":\"552524\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"381440\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Lilo \\u0026amp; Stitch [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99216599994,\\\"daysShown\\\":32,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":true,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Kids Club\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Kids Club\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-films some-showings-kids-club every-showings-kids-club showing-status-has-played showing-status-now-playing-or-has-played\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391940\",\"time\":\"2026-02-07T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":14,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":46,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"391941\",\"time\":\"2026-02-08T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":32,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":69,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"399146\",\"time\":\"2026-02-16T12:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"399159\",\"time\":\"2026-02-17T16:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":93,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"399185\",\"time\":\"2026-02-19T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":24,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":36,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"464773\",\"time\":\"2026-08-22T13:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"464774\",\"time\":\"2026-08-23T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31214\",\"name\":\"Bring Your Own Baby Comedy Club\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"bring-your-own-baby-comedy-club\",\"posterImage\":\"hjhgts1l8870cv04to1o8rgfhqpb\",\"bannerImage\":\"9ywkwzecy92jnf8xfr7xhpsqwtue\",\"synopsis\":\"WINNER: Best bring-along Baby Event (HOOP Awards)\\nWINNER: Comedy Club of the Year 2024 (Innovation and Excellence Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Mental Health Boost for New Parents 2022 (UK Enterprise Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Comedy Event for Families 2023 (Prestige Awards)\\nNOMINATED: Feed With Confidence Award 2018\\n\\n“Yaaaas! This is the maternity leave I have dreamed of!” – Michelle, BYOB Guest\\n\\n“Bring Your Own Baby Comedy has transformed parental leave” – i paper\\n\\u2028\\nJoin us for an afternoon of hilarious comedy, where you can relax and have a good laugh at the best comedians in the UK, without needing childcare! There’s buggy parking, baby changing so that you can take some time for yourself and just be entertained. The bar is fully stocked, whether you fancy a cuppa or even something a bit stronger (G\\u0026T anyone?). If you need to whip out a bum (the baby’s please!), a boob or a bottle, then please feel free… and our comics won’t mind being heckled by our younger guests!*\\n\\nEach show features two brilliant comedians plus a compere, and the whole show will last approx. 75 minutes including an interval.\\n\\n*Please note that we have a 15-month age limit for our little laughers, as our comedians will be performing their usual grown-up jokes!\\n\\n*Please note that buggies cannot be brought into the performance space with you so please bring a sling if your baby would like to relax during the show\\n* If you are coming with twins or have any additional needs, please contact our friendly team at info@byobcomedy.com\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-09\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"420\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99222599993,\\\"daysShown\\\":139,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":true,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"Baby Friendly\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"Baby Friendly\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-special-events some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-ad-free some-showings-baby-friendly every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-ad-free every-showings-baby-friendly showing-status-has-played showing-status-now-playing-or-has-played\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362962\",\"time\":\"2025-12-09T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":73,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":52,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362963\",\"time\":\"2026-02-10T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":46,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":79,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394890\",\"time\":\"2026-04-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":55,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":70,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394891\",\"time\":\"2026-06-09T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":104,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394892\",\"time\":\"2026-09-15T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394893\",\"time\":\"2026-10-27T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394894\",\"time\":\"2026-12-08T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31311\",\"name\":\"A Minecraft Movie\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"a-minecraft-movie\",\"posterImage\":\"xf07ekuxiyifc4g6e0wkgc7xxrsd\",\"bannerImage\":\"d6qimpiovvgl4wgoc9yd988olpu6\",\"synopsis\":\"Welcome to the world of Minecraft, where creativity doesn’t just help you craft, it’s essential to one’s survival!  Four misfits—Garrett “The Garbage Man” Garrison (Momoa), Henry (Hansen), Natalie (Myers) and Dawn (Brooks)—find themselves struggling with ordinary problems when they are suddenly pulled through a mysterious portal into the Overworld: a bizarre, cubic wonderland that thrives on imagination.  To get back home, they’ll have to master this world (and protect it from evil things like Piglins and Zombies, too) while embarking on a magical quest with an unexpected, expert crafter, Steve (Black).  Together, their adventure will challenge all five to be bold and to reconnect with the qualities that make each of them uniquely creative…the very skills they need to thrive back in the real world.\",\"starring\":\"Jason Momoa, Jack Black, Sebastian Eugene Hansen\",\"directedBy\":\"Jared Hess\",\"producedBy\":\"Jason Momoa, Roy Lee, Mary Parent, Cale Boyter, Torfi Frans Ólafsson, Vu Bui, Jill Messick, Jon Berg\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":101,\"genre\":\"Adventure\",\"allGenres\":\"Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Action\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"iLO4oQwn80g\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-11-08\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":30.1322,\"tmdbId\":\"950387\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"169976\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"MINECRAFT MOVIE, A [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99225699994,\\\"daysShown\\\":25,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":true,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Kids Club\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Kids Club\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-films some-showings-kids-club every-showings-kids-club showing-status-has-played showing-status-now-playing-or-has-played\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"364478\",\"time\":\"2025-11-08T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":49,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"364479\",\"time\":\"2025-11-09T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":12,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":48,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"389174\",\"time\":\"2026-01-17T10:55:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":99,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"389180\",\"time\":\"2026-01-18T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":38,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":63,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"464771\",\"time\":\"2026-08-15T13:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"464772\",\"time\":\"2026-08-16T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38989\",\"name\":\"WHAM! 10 Days In China\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"wham-10-days-in-china\",\"posterImage\":\"tlhvn81pwi5rsq1thxxyvpqfn4c9\",\"bannerImage\":\"g8509zeoygtf7adfc3p84yf3d9c5\",\"synopsis\":\"In 1985, WHAM! made history as the first Western pop act to perform in communist China. GeorgeMichael and Andrew Ridgeley’s concerts in Beijing and Guangzhou were a cultural milestone – Eastmeets West, music meets politics. Now, newly restored footage reveals the untold story of the iconictour that helped launch WHAM! to global superstardom.\",\"starring\":\"George Michael, Andrew Ridgeley\",\"directedBy\":\"Mike Christie\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":\"Music, Documentary\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"P7oAaJqqv8w\",\"trailerV