,\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"French Impressions\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"French Impressions\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-films some-showings-intro some-showings-ad-free some-showings-french-impressions every-showings-intro every-showings-ad-free every-showings-french-impressions showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"466806\",\"time\":\"2026-11-07T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"intro ad-free french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39090\",\"name\":\"Ran\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"ran\",\"posterImage\":\"arrk5acrb8akptgiwba2phwlyuyo\",\"bannerImage\":\"xvvpfnx8yhxievbbcs3jq06vdlww\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eDirected by Akira Kurosawa and starring Tatsuya Nakadai, this Japanese film is a stunning version of King Lear that in some ways improves on the original. The Gloucester sub-plot is cut and the warrior-king's youngest son foresees the chaos that will ensue from the division of power.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eAbout the season:\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003ePeople often say that if Shakespeare were alive today he would be writing for the movies. What is startling is how often, since the beginnings of cinema, his plays have been adapted for the screen.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eFollowing a highly successful season devoted to the work of Harold Pinter, Chiswick Cinema now focuses on the infinite variety of filmed Shakespeare and will accompany four major screenings with talks, supplementary showings and celebrity interviews.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":161,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"YwP_kXyd-Rw\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-11-08\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-08\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"38837\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Ran (40Th Anniversary) (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99310999994,\\\"daysShown\\\":109,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Q\\\\u0026A\\\",\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Shakespeare on Screen\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Q\\\\u0026A\\\",\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Shakespeare on Screen\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-classics some-showings-qa some-showings-intro some-showings-shakespeare-on-screen every-showings-qa every-showings-intro every-showings-shakespeare-on-screen showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"465460\",\"time\":\"2026-11-08T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"qa intro shakespeare-on-screen\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37996\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: Carmen\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-carmen\",\"posterImage\":\"8vub98ztzfia469zw0cjxlfmoix4\",\"bannerImage\":\"kpiyss8ekl8xb4kz5q8kyvhquks1\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eUnder the oppressive heat of the Spanish sun, the fiercely independent Carmen attracts the attention of Don José. She warns him not to fall in love with her, but his obsession knows no bounds. Damiano Michieletto’s searing production returns, casting scorching light on the lust, violence and destructive desire of Bizet’s ever-popular opera.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAn all-star cast brings this white-hot drama to life, with Ginger Costa-Jackson in the fiery title role, alongside Russell Thomas as the jealous and despairing Don José. Following his 2023 Royal Opera debut, Sesto Quatrini returns to conduct Bizet’s electrifying and sensual score.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Ginger Costa-Jackson, Russell Thomas, Adriana González, Alexander Vinogradov, Barnaby Rea\",\"directedBy\":\"Damiano Michieletto\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":215,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-11-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500515\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Carmen - Rbo, London 2026 (Opera) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99311199994,\\\"daysShown\\\":119,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442011\",\"time\":\"2026-11-10T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442092\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18T11:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":99,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"35435\",\"name\":\"Narrow Margin\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"narrow-margin\",\"posterImage\":\"9gxqj7y1sg7b5vfe4a9qtu9q7r0m\",\"bannerImage\":\"c22mikwz7e71gfppx9pjw7dmuxam\",\"synopsis\":\"Local film critic and podcaster Matthew Turner returns for a third mini season of film noir classics, which will run exclusively at Chiswick Cinema throughout November 2026.\\n\\n\\\"Directed by Richard Fleischer, this terrific noir thriller is a model of economy, taking place almost entirely aboard a train. Charles McGraw stars as a police detective who's assigned to protect an important witness (Marie Windsor) as she rides a train from Chicago to Los Angeles, before she testifies against the mob.\\\"\\n\\nSynopsis:\\nPack your bags for one of movie history's greatest trips, a nifty film noir thriller that Time deemed \\\"worthy of being bracketed in the select group of train thrillers headed by Alfred Hitchcock's The Lady Vanishes.\\\" These train tracks run direct from Chicago to L.A. in this Oscar-nominated story, directed by Richard Fleischer (The Boston Strangler) and scripted by his frequent collaborator Earl Felton, The Narrow Margin zigzags with surprise turns. Film noir favorite Charles McGraw plays a cop guarding a gangster's moll (fellow genre icon Marie Windsor) as she travels west to testify before a grand jury. Also riding the Pullmans: determined hitmen who know the moll is on the train, but don't know what she looks like. All aboard!\",\"starring\":\"Charlie MacGraw, Marie Windsor, Jacqueline White, Queenie Leonard, Gordon Gebert, David Clarke\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Fleischer\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":72,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OZtFTnm8GnY\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-11-11\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-11\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"932008\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Narrow Margin (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99311299994,\\\"daysShown\\\":112,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"Noirvember\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"Noirvember\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-classics some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-intro some-showings-ad-free some-showings-noirvember every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-intro every-showings-ad-free every-showings-noirvember showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"406245\",\"time\":\"2026-11-11T19:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":99,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free noirvember\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39373\",\"name\":\"Funny Face\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"funny-face\",\"posterImage\":\"j6cnhjmj30xx9i5e3enxmxk3forq\",\"bannerImage\":\"ls9mwtlfn55hn5839ozjhm50ylgf\",\"synopsis\":\"A shy Greenwich Village book clerk is discovered by a fashion photographer and whisked off to Paris where she becomes a reluctant model.\",\"starring\":\"Audrey Hepburn, Fred Astaire, Kay Thompson\",\"directedBy\":\"Stanley Donen\",\"producedBy\":\"Roger Edens\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":103,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":\"Music, Comedy, Romance\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Hs6ASCq9YtY\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1957-02-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-11\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":2.42