35439\",\"name\":\"Laura\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"laura\",\"posterImage\":\"nhbq1ntqaobk1q07r2w5q3negzun\",\"bannerImage\":\"vvzzhfwvixa3gdrqtmr24py98d0f\",\"synopsis\":\"Local film critic and podcaster Matthew Turner returns for a third mini season of film noir classics, which will run exclusively at Chiswick Cinema throughout November 2026.\\n\\n\\\"Otto Preminger's twisted noir classic stars Dana Andrews as a cop who falls in love with Laura (Gene Tierney), the beautiful woman whose murder he's investigating. Slippery suspects include Cliften Webb as imperious columnist Waldo Lydecker and a pre-horror Vincent Price as Laura's parasitic playboy fiance, Shelby Carpenter.\\\"\\n\\nSynopsis:\\nA police detective falls in love with the woman whose murder he is investigating.\",\"starring\":\"Gene Tierney, Dana Andrews, Clifton Webb\",\"directedBy\":\"Otto Preminger\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":88,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KgGtRJY516E\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-11-18\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-18\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"23077\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Laura (Re: 2012) (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99311999994,\\\"daysShown\\\":119,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"Noirvember\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Intro\\\",\\\"Ad Free\\\",\\\"Noirvember\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-classics some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-intro some-showings-ad-free some-showings-noirvember every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-show