\\"French Impressions\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-films some-showings-intro some-showings-ad-free some-showings-french-impressions every-showings-intro every-showings-ad-free every-showings-french-impressions showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"466836\",\"time\":\"2027-01-09T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"intro ad-free french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39767\",\"name\":\"Le Week-End\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"le-week-end\",\"posterImage\":\"v9vfai6fb0el79rk84s4qglgefkz\",\"bannerImage\":\"kp8ze7hg3smkwimum0irfpge76wp\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eA British couple return to Paris many years after their honeymoon there in an attempt to rejuvenate their marriage.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Jeff Goldblum, Jim Broadbent, Olly Alexander, Lindsay Duncan, Brice Beaugier\",\"directedBy\":\"Roger Michell\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":93,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"CatPXJu0-H0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-01-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-01-13\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"147260\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Le Week-End (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99317599994,\\\"daysShown\\\":175,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Knitflicks\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Knitflicks\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-classics some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-knitflicks every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-knitflicks showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"465479\",\"time\":\"2027-01-13T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser knitflicks\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38120\",\"name\":\"Exhibition on Screen: Renoir \\u0026 Love\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-renoir-love\",\"posterImage\":\"k8r7o7yc8906pn6747gy0mvzpfak\",\"bannerImage\":\"36w0ktpl4qsmyu44jny8vcynvo6h\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003ePierre-Auguste Renoir is one of the world’s favourite artists; a founding member of the Impressionist movement and a constantly evolving artist, he is unmatched at depicting human connection. The National Gallery’s blockbuster exhibition brings together vibrant masterpieces which explore love in all its forms, bringing colour and warmth into the cold winter months.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eWith exclusive access to this exciting new show, Exhibition on Screen will bring these world class works to cinema audiences, with close examination of the art and leading experts exploring the immense skill and influence of this master of colour and connection. Be transported back to a Parisian summer of love through the eyes of a true visionary.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAn unmissable opportunity to fall in love with Renoir this winter.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eMade in close collaboration with The National Gallery, London and Musee d’Orsay, Paris.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Ali Ray\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-01-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-01-19\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"511702\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition on screen: renoir \\u0026amp; love 2027 (exhibition) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99318199994,\\\"daysShown\\\":186,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"454561\",\"time\":\"2027-01-19T17:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"454567\",\"time\":\"2027-01-24T17:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38004\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: La Fanciulla Del West\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-la-fanciulla-del-west\",\"posterImage\":\"ntx16d4a5ibkwhtbwrhoejw078ib\",\"bannerImage\":\"udiy6uwp8jode889amm2tt6ubtk9\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 15.6933px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, sans-serif\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px;\\\"\\u003ePuccini’s exhilarating drama of the Wild West returns in a new staging by Richard Jones, marking the\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003ecompany’s first new production of La Fanciulla del West in more than 30 years.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 15.6933px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eSoprano Vida\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eMiknevičiūtė makes her Met company debut singing the role of Minnie, the tough tavern owner with\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003ea heart of gold who finds love when she least expects it. Tenor SeokJong Baek is the dashing bandit\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003ewho rambles into the remote California mining town to steal her heart, opposite baritone\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eChristopher Maltman as the lawman determined to deliver justice—and win Minnie for himself.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 15.6933px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eMaestro Keri-Lynn Wilson takes the podium to conduct one of opera’s most action-packed\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eadventures, live from the Met stage to cinemas worldwide.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Vida Miknevičiūtė , SeokJong Baek, Christopher Maltman\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Jones\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":195,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-01-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-01-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"512068\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"La Fanciulla Del West - Met Opera 2027 (Opera) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99318599994,\\\"daysShown\\\":189,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"441996\",\"time\":\"2027-01-23T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"441997\",\"time\":\"2027-01-27T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37998\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: Götterdämmerung\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-gtterdmmerung\",\"posterImage\":\"aqg7ps2fk0qi27u5wiklxzhmv2hu\",\"bannerImage\":\"xvcx77jxwnk1jdxizxwczee745ef\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\\"\\u003eAn earth in ruin. The twilight of the Gods.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eDeception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Brünnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved’s innocence, Brünnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. For the long-awaited finale of Wagner’s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary world of dream-like turmoil. Antonio Pappano, Conductor Laureate of The Royal Opera, returns to take on the impassioned, otherworldly music – including Siegfried’s transporting Funeral March and Brünnhilde’s electrifying Immolation Scene. The brilliant cast is led by Elisabet Strid, Andreas Schager and Mika Kares, who together with the full forces of the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House and the Royal Opera Chorus bring opera’s greatest journey to its shattering end.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Andreas Schager, Thomas Lehman, Mika Kares, Christopher Purves, Elisabet Strid, Amanda Majeski, Annika Schlicht, Noa Beinart, Claire Barnett-Jones, Catharine Woodward, Sarah Brady, Niamh O’sullivan, Sian Griffiths\",\"directedBy\":\"Barrie Kosky\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":350,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-02-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-02-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500518\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Gotterdammerung - Rbo, London 2027 (Opera) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99319699994,\\\"daysShown\\\":203,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442095\",\"time\":\"2027-02-03T16:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442096\",\"time\":\"2027-02-10T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37999\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: Così Fan Tutte\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-cos-fan-tutte\",\"posterImage\":\"ynn56efhz4dkf9p1989wz8rse77j\",\"bannerImage\":\"sj4x89263zd9qxgoet4q2jefth84\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eSpurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eCosì fan tutte has lost none of its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stage debut, Netia Jones, Associate Director of The Royal Opera, reimagines Mozart’s comedy of manners through a sharp contemporary lens, where 18th-century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical high-tech deceit. Taking on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder, Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall, with Gerald Finley as their manipulative game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as Despina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts, bringing out the exquisite melodies that underpin the provocative, and resolutely modern, themes at the heart of the opera.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Louise Alder, Simone Mcintosh, Mingjie Lei, Huw Montague Rendall, Gerald Finley, Emily Pogorelc\",\"directedBy\":\"Netia Jones\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-02-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-02-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500519\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Cosi Fan Tutte - Rbo, London 2027 (Opera) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99321699994,\\\"daysShown\\\":223,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442098\",\"time\":\"2027-02-23T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442950\",\"time\":\"2027-03-02T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38106\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Silent Night\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-silent-night\",\"posterImage\":\"i0p0cv42vutejkb58d8tk0lhl0bd\",\"bannerImage\":\"rsn4h14vscgn5r8il7nqn5yc8g38\",\"synopsis\":\"Following his smash-hit company debut with The Hours, composer Kevin Puts returns to the Met with his Pulitzer Prize–winning opera, inspired by the true events of the 1914 Christmas truce. A poignant depiction of shared humanity in the most inhumane circumstances, Puts’s grand, cinematic opera—with a libretto in English, French, and German by Mark Campbell—has been widely acclaimed since its 2011 premiere, hailed as “an overwhelming emotive experience” by The Guardian. The evocative staging by James Robinson takes the audience directly to the battlefields of the Western Front with a star-studded cast, featuring soprano Elza van den Heever and tenors Ben Bliss and Rolando Villazón, conducted by Maestro Dalia Stasevska live from the Met to cinemas worldwide.\",\"starring\":\"Elza van den Heever, Ben Bliss, Rolando Villazón\",\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":180,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-03-20\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-03-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"484879\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"#Runseokjin_Ep.Tour The Movie (Concert) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99324199994,\\\"daysShown\\\":245,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"441998\",\"time\":\"2027-03-20T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"441999\",\"time\":\"2027-03-24T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38000\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Alice's Adventures In Wonderland\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-alices-adventures-in-wonderland\",\"posterImage\":\"ef6ybz7ofums9misff7grtb7h8pp\",\"bannerImage\":\"d2resuaa6v7an92w176bppas3ftw\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eAt a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream?\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eChristopher Wheeldon’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot’s score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley’s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious music and design.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Francesca Hayward, William Bracewell, James Hay, Lauren Cuthbertson, Bennet Gartside, Steven Mcrae, Nicol Edmonds, Gary Avis\",\"directedBy\":\"Christopher Wheeldon\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":170,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-03-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-03-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500547\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alice's Adventures In Wonderland 2024 - Rbo, London 2027 (Ballet) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99324499994,\\\"daysShown\\\":252,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442100\",\"time\":\"2027-03-23T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":93,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442111\",\"time\":\"2027-03-31T12:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38107\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Manon\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-manon\",\"posterImage\":\"e73gro22csad94u8vc4i5jggp0n3\",\"bannerImage\":\"hz3rr1lbfk31f0lxs7t6vy7e72x1\",\"synopsis\":\"Following her radiant performance in Gounod’s Roméo et Juliette—which garnered raves for “high notes that spun like liquid gold … Sierra touched the operatic firmament” (The New York Times)—superstar soprano Nadine Sierra takes on another alluring French heroine, the irresistible title character of Massenet’s passionate drama, live from the Met stage to cinemas worldwide. Leading tenor Matthew Polenzani is her idealistic lover, the Chevalier des Grieux, with rising-star baritone Andrzej Filończyk as her stalwart cousin, Lescaut, in a breathtaking staging by director Laurent Pelly.\",\"starring\":\"Matthew Polenzani, Andrzej Filończyk\",\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":264,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-04-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-04-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"484879\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"#Runseokjin_Ep.Tour The Movie (Concert) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99325599994,\\\"daysShown\\\":259,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442000\",\"time\":\"2027-04-03T16:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442001\",\"time\":\"2027-04-07T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38001\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Swan Lake\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-swan-lake\",\"posterImage\":\"lhoy0ggho9tzhoosp16gmmfv35bg\",\"bannerImage\":\"ognmuilo7j67s3c5ryhxsqrcurub\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003ePrincess Odette is bound by a curse, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and pledges to free her. But freedom is not promised for Odette as Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers’ plans.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eLiam Scarlett’s production for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky’s towering score and John Macfarlane’s picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet spectacle of love, treachery and forgiveness.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Christopher Wheeldon\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":205,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-04-22\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-04-22\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500520\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Swan Lake - Rbo, London 2027 (Ballet) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99327499994,\\\"daysShown\\\":279,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442112\",\"time\":\"2027-04-22T18:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":92,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442113\",\"time\":\"2027-04-27T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38109\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Otello\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-otello\",\"posterImage\":\"xqnuubzmbdz8r86a67yzjgr6d7j7\",\"bannerImage\":\"undn34g4f9sxxl1qb0z5icbfxght\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003eOne of today’s leading dramatic tenors, Brian Jagde, takes on the tour-de-force title role of what many consider the ultimate Italian opera, live to cinemas worldwide. Verdi’s monumental Shakespearean tragedy also features soprano Ailyn Pérez in her company role debut as the long-suffering Desdemona, alongside baritone Artur Ruciński as the sinister Iago. Michele Mariotti leads the full forces of the Met Orchestra and Chorus in the exhilarating score.\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Brian Jagde, Ailyn Pérez, Artur Ruciński\",\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":201,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-04-24\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-04-24\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"484879\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"#Runseokjin_Ep.Tour The Movie (Concert) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99327699994,\\\"daysShown\\\":280,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442002\",\"time\":\"2027-04-24T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442003\",\"time\":\"2027-04-28T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38002\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: Tosca\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-tosca\",\"posterImage\":\"m5li1ev8jodmylht9v6naobuqkqo\",\"bannerImage\":\"cpqoymtozc8mrah8z423rx1l3epb\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eFloria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eOliver Mears’s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini’s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Aleksandra Kurzak, Saimir Pirgu, Christopher Maltman, Aled Hall, Jonathan Lemalu, Paweł Horodyski, Sam Hird\",\"directedBy\":\"Aleksandra Kurzak, Saimir Pirgu, Christopher Maltman, Aled Hall, Jonathan Lemalu, Paweł Horodyski\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":195,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-05-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-05-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500521\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Tosca - Rbo, London 2027 (Opera) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99328799994,\\\"daysShown\\\":294,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442115\",\"time\":\"2027-05-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":96,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442116\",\"time\":\"2027-05-12T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38121\",\"name\":\"Exhibition on Screen: Monet\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-monet\",\"posterImage\":\"go5hp9iu0oodks0m0oxhcbjaef9d\",\"bannerImage\":\"wuhuypz7f8lhud4nj2jjc9harwo9\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eTo celebrate Tate Britain’s blockbuster Monet and Time exhibition, Exhibition on Screen is delighted to bring the iconic story of Claude Monet to cinema\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003escreens in May 2027. Undeniably one of the world’s favourite artists and the figurehead of the Impressionist movement prepare to be dazzled by his spectacular and revolutionary use of light and colour and step into one the most famous gardens in art history. Immerse yourself in iconic masterpieces and discover the incredible story of passion and rebellion in this exciting documentary on the man who named the world’s favourite art movement.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-05-11\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-05-11\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"210930\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: I, Claude Monet (Exhibition) (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99329399994,\\\"daysShown\\\":298,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"454589\",\"time\":\"2027-05-11T16:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"454590\",\"time\":\"2027-05-16T16:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38003\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Romeo \\u0026 Juliet\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-romeo-juliet\",\"posterImage\":\"mfkj3pbr4oxaxgxuwzxvjw9o5n8p\",\"bannerImage\":\"1721lq7tcdqoktds3sh39x26riw9\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe Capulets and Montagues are sworn enemies. Yet it is love at first sight for Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet when they meet each other at the Capulet ball, into which Romeo has snuck. The two fall in love and they profess their devotion to each other at Juliet’s balcony. They secretly get married.\\u0026nbsp; \\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe stakes are raised for the young couple when Romeo avenges the death of his friend Mercutio who has been killed by Tybalt, Juliet’s cousin. For this, Romeo is exiled from Verona. Meanwhile, Juliet’s parents are forcing her to marry another suitor. In order to be together, Romeo and Juliet must risk it all.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Fumi Kaneko, Vadim Muntagirov, Francisco Serrano, Ryoichi Hirano, Giacomo Rovero, Lukas B. Brændsrød, Bennet Gartside, Christina Arestis, Harris Bell, Annette Buvoli, Olivia Cowley, Thomas Whitehead, Thomas Whitehead, Lara Turk\",\"directedBy\":\"Kenneth MacMillan\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":170,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-05-25\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-05-25\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"500522\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Romeo \\u0026amp; Juliet 2025 - Rbo, London 2027 (Ballet) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99330799994,\\\"daysShown\\\":314,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-event-cinema some-showings-51 some-showings-4k some-showings-laser some-showings-event-cinema every-showings-51 every-showings-4k every-showings-laser every-showings-event-cinema showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442117\",\"time\":\"2027-05-25T18:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":93,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"442118\",\"time\":\"2027-06-01T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38110\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Parsifal\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-parsifal\",\"posterImage\":\"b8yuygwzoyxzrdedaqq6int7oh9o\",\"bannerImage\":\"n3rv1rlktlcyqwso6tgi99i8uykz\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\\"\\u003eA profound philosophical meditation on compassion and reconciliation, this transcendent rendering of a medieval knight’s heroic quest for the Holy Grail returns to the big screen in François Girard’s celebrated production, a “thoughtful and intrepid staging, full of striking imagery” (\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003ci style=\\\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\\"\\u003eThe New York Times\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\\"\\u003e). Yannick Nézet-Séguin conducts a cast of Wagnerian superstars, including tenor Piotr Beczała in the title role, mezzo-soprano Elīna Garanča as the enigmatic Kundry, baritone Peter Mattei as the ailing Amfortas, bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as the sorcerer Klingsor, and bass Jongmin Park as the wise Gurnemanz.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Piotr Beczała, Elīna Garanča, Peter Mattei, Ryan Speedo Green, Jongmin Park\",\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":365,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-06-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-06-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"484879\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"#Runseokjin_Ep.Tour The Movie (Concert) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99331899994,\\\"daysShown\\\":322,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"5.1\\\",\\\"4K\\\",\\\"Laser\\\",\\\"Event Cinema\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\